{"productId": "a5b49c8a-1388-41d8-af7e-d71876dc0d57", "modelName": "T3x Lite Roughtech Specter", "modelDescription": "The Tikka T3X Lite Roughtech Bolt-Action Rifle is an innovative, well-designed, lightweight hunting rifle, that shoots accurately and functions flawlessly. The T3X Lite Roughtech features a synthetic stock with an all-weather grip, and a fluted, threaded, and cold hammer-forged barrel for optimal accuracy and corrosion resistance. The T3X features a fluted, 2-lug bolt with a 75\u00b0 lift that cycles smooth as silk. The 75\u00b0 bolt lift aids in keeping hand and gloves away from the scope and speeds the cycling process. An enlarged ejection port facilitates feeding rounds one at a time. A single column polymer magazine feeds reliably, and facilitates in loading and unloading the rifle. An enhanced recoil pad drastically reduces felt recoil for optimal control and reduced fatigue, while aggressive grip texturing on the pistol grip ensures a firm, non-slip grip\u2014even with gloved hands. The T3X Lite Bolt-Action Rifle features a single stage adjustable trigger that breaks crisp and clean, allowing hunters to make quick, accurate shots under field conditions.", "manufacturerName": "Tikka", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "131b4dd6-4cc9-40d2-a67a-7bcafa4e9dd9", "description": "Tikka, T3x Lite Roughtech, Bolt Action, 243 Winchester, 20 Fluted/Threaded Barrel, Black Finish,  Firstlite Specter Camo Synthetic Stock, Right Hand, 3 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/adbb0615-aa96-4e6d-852e-e1b0a1edcde6", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a6ce2262-cfab-42cf-8610-a0786d0ebff7", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/9b417ce0-b34b-45cd-85cf-6f16a2df7c6a", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/90de8a9c-00f2-4b6b-9a20-614e59a1f549", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/fca489d2-351a-4aa3-8d30-972eaf30479e"], "isDefault": fals